{"id":"275a393f15768c53","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyGoodTApp.md","title":"PolyGoodTApp","display":"PolyGoodTApp","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyGoodTApp","parameters":["d","r","b","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyGoodTApp"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>d</span><span>r</span><span>b</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 类型判断与独立算法。有序参数：<code>d</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>b</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyGoodTApp d r b a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists c\n  (exists ar\n    (exists z\n      (and (@ PolyTy d b) (and (@ FForall c ar) (and (@ OK ar r) (and (@ Num0 z) (@ FTyInst z b c a))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b4002d1847fb33d0\" href=\"?note=b4002d1847fb33d0\" title=\"ZFC_FForall\">FForall</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"49b51d8f3325b677\" href=\"?note=49b51d8f3325b677\" title=\"ZFC_FTyInst\">FTyInst</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c6f16aed01caed9d\" href=\"?note=c6f16aed01caed9d\" title=\"ZFC_OK\">OK</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d8ed31ea0d65b588\" href=\"?note=d8ed31ea0d65b588\" title=\"ZFC_PolyTy\">PolyTy</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PolyGoodTApp d r b a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FForall","status":"resolved","id":"b4002d1847fb33d0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FForall|FForall]]；[[ZFC_FTyInst|FTyInst]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_OK|OK]]；[[ZFC_PolyTy|PolyTy]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FTyInst","status":"resolved","id":"49b51d8f3325b677","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FForall|FForall]]；[[ZFC_FTyInst|FTyInst]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_OK|OK]]；[[ZFC_PolyTy|PolyTy]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Num0","status":"resolved","id":"e8cec2782b4668b5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FForall|FForall]]；[[ZFC_FTyInst|FTyInst]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_OK|OK]]；[[ZFC_PolyTy|PolyTy]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_OK","status":"resolved","id":"c6f16aed01caed9d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FForall|FForall]]；[[ZFC_FTyInst|FTyInst]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_OK|OK]]；[[ZFC_PolyTy|PolyTy]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PolyTy","status":"resolved","id":"d8ed31ea0d65b588","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FForall|FForall]]；[[ZFC_FTyInst|FTyInst]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_OK|OK]]；[[ZFC_PolyTy|PolyTy]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707",